+# audio.dem — Story 7.2's determinism golden (ODN-15): the app's audio
+# consumer (crisis sting + arrival click, variant draws from the app-owned
+# cosmetic rng ONLY — never the sim rng) interleaves between sim steps, and
+# the T1 + replay gate prove the sim stream is byte-identical with audio on
+# or off: the live run consumes (draws), the replay re-sims from the blessed
+# log WITHOUT the consumer, and the gate requires the manifest to match
+# bit-for-bit.
+#
+# The recipe is the 4.2 surge set-up (narrow res->router->host path, era 3 —
+# the streaming demand saturates the flaw, the surge fires at tick 1200 =
+# 60 s) plus explicit res->host spawns (first at tick 41 = 2000 ms) to
+# thicken the arrival stream. Arrivals actually start at tick ~16 — that
+# early flow is the era-3 DIRECTOR's streaming demand, not the explicit
+# spawns (the narrow bottleneck serializes deliveries ~1 per 6 ticks — the
+# DENSE-TICK throttle claim lives in audio_throttle.dem, which uses a wide
+# path). The consumer therefore exercises BOTH alert kinds: 1 crisis sting
+# draw + arrival-click draws (throttled at 2 ticks — see
+# ARRIVAL_MIN_GAP_TICKS in app/audio/audio.odin).
+seed 4243
+run 70000ms
+era 3
+fixture off
+spawn_node residential 8 15
+spawn_node router_basic 14 15
+spawn_node content_host 20 15
+at 100ms draw 0 1 narrow
+at 100ms draw 1 2 narrow
+at 2000ms spawn 0 2
+at 4000ms spawn 0 2
+at 8000ms spawn 0 2
+at 16000ms spawn 0 2
diff --git a/demos/audio_throttle.dem b/demos/audio_throttle.dem
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..c5607b2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/demos/audio_throttle.dem
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# audio_throttle.dem — the arrival-throttle golden (r1 W4): a WIDE path with
+# the streaming class split onto its Express lane delivers back-to-back
+# (wide cap 40 -> ceil(30/40) = 1 tick per edge), so a tight spawn burst
+# (500/550/600 ms = ticks 11/12/13) lands arrivals on adjacent ticks — the
+# consumer's throttle (ARRIVAL_MIN_GAP_TICKS = 2) MUST suppress some of them
+# (the golden asserts suppressed >= 1: plays < arrivals on a dense tick).
+# The era-3 director's streaming demand rides the same Express lane, adding
+# more density for free. T1-only (no captures) — the audio golden family.
+seed 42
+run 4000ms
+era 3
+at 100ms draw 0 1 wide
+at 100ms draw 1 2 wide
+at 200ms lane 0 streaming express
+at 200ms lane 1 streaming express
+at 500ms spawn 0 2 streaming
+at 550ms spawn 0 2 streaming
+at 600ms spawn 0 2 streaming
